    "Neechan plays WebM through FFmpeg, which is distributed under the GPL. The app is therefore GPL-3.0 as well, and its source is available.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Neechan plays WebM through FFmpeg, which is distributed under the GPL. The app is therefore GPL-3.0 as well, and its source is available."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Neechan воспроизводит WebM через FFmpeg, распространяемый по GPL. Поэтому приложение тоже под GPL-3.0, и его исходный код открыт."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Neechan spielt WebM über FFmpeg ab, das unter der GPL vertrieben wird. Deshalb steht die App ebenfalls unter GPL-3.0, und ihr Quelltext ist verfügbar."
          }
        }
      }
    },
